#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:1
msgid "Zhangjiang AI Town compute, model and corpus support"
msgstr "张江AI创新小镇算力券、模型券、语料券"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:4
msgid "Reimbursement | Pudong"
msgstr "报销支持｜浦东新区"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:6
msgid "Quarterly scheme published; current intake to confirm"
msgstr "季度机制已公布，当前批次待确认"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:8

#| msgid ""
#| "`Evidence S110 "
#| "<https://www.pudong.gov.cn/zwgk/qsjj_zdgz_lhbl/2026/156/355831.html>`_. "
#| "浦数局办理〔2026〕16号（对浦东新区七届人大六次会议第076146号代表建议的答复）_两会办理."
msgid ""
"`Evidence S113 "
"<https://www.pudong.gov.cn/zwgk/qsjj_zdgz_lhbl/2026/156/355831.html>`_. "
"浦数局办理〔2026〕16号（对浦东新区七届人大六次会议第076146号代表建议的答复）_两会办理."
msgstr "`证据 S113 <https://www.pudong.gov.cn/zwgk/qsjj_zdgz_lhbl/2026/156/355831.html>`_. 浦数局办理〔2026〕16号（对浦东新区七届人大六次会议第076146号代表建议的答复）_两会办理."

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:13
msgid ""
"Up to 100% of approved actual cost, capped at RMB 1m in each category; at "
"most one year"
msgstr "核定实际支出最高100%，各类最高100万元，单个企业最多享受一年"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:20
msgid ""
"AI companies registered and operating inside the specified town boundary, "
"established or moved there no earlier than 1 Jan 2025. Expenses must be "
"for qualifying model R&D or deployment; review the current quarterly "
"guide."
msgstr "注册经营在明确小镇范围内，且成立或迁入不早于2025年1月1日的人工智能企业；支出须用于合资格模型研发应用，并审核当季指南。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:22
msgid "Quarterly claims; confirm the current batch"
msgstr "按季度申报，确认当前批次"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:27
msgid "`Official application / policy route <https://pyd.pudong.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://pyd.pudong.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 58811024 ext. 5091."
msgstr "公布咨询电话：+86 21 58811024 ext. 5091。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:33
msgid ""
"Confirm the actual category, area boundary, supplier and eligible "
"expenditure period."
msgstr "确认实际类别、范围、供应商及合资格支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:35
msgid ""
"Keep service contracts, invoices, payment evidence and itemized usage "
"logs."
msgstr "保留服务合同、发票、付款凭证及明细用量记录。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:37
msgid ""
"Use the named platform and current batch; obtain the required district or "
"operator review."
msgstr "使用指定平台及当前批次，完成规定区级或运营方审核。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:39
msgid ""
"Check approved amount, duplicate-funding exclusions and payment "
"conditions."
msgstr "核验认可额度、重复资助限制及拨付条件。"

#: ../../funding/zhangjiang-ai-vouchers.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
